# development_baseline_20260904.sha256
#
# SHA-256 manifest of the 2026 Korea development/pilot normal baseline.
# NOT the official German field dataset.
#
# Covers exactly these 5 trials and nothing else. Other directories under
# dataset/_smoke (short orchestration tests that share the `normal` scenario id)
# are deliberately excluded.
#
#   normal_20260904T074717Z
#   normal_20260904T075323Z
#   normal_20260904T075930Z
#   normal_20260904T080536Z
#   normal_20260904T081141Z
#
# Paths are relative to the DATASET ROOT (<repo>/dataset), not the repo root,
# so the manifest stays valid wherever the dataset is mounted. Verify with:
#
#   cd <repo>/dataset && sha256sum -c ../docs/manifests/development_baseline_20260904.sha256
#
# A missing file, an extra file inside one of these 5 trials, or any checksum
# mismatch means preprocessing and training MUST NOT start. See
# docs/SERVER_WORKSTATION_HANDOFF.md.
#
